| DFS item being retired | What it does today | Replaced by | Owner and commitment status |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Monetary Transfers Application (MTA)**, DFS mainframe | Consolidates settlements from all network channels into flat files for OPF | Payment Network Originator, a new build in GPN, sending to PayX by API | GPN owned and committed, in build |
| **Compliance Link and DFS OFAC services** | OFAC sanctions screening | Bridger and the PayX OFAC service | EP and AML (Bridger), active engagement. Compliance Link goes early 2027, so this cannot slip. |
| **DFS Quantum** (treasury) | Treasury management, cash positioning, system of record for Nostro accounts | COF Quantum | COF Treasury, active discussion (eBAM, Nostro account qualification). Targeted about Q4 2026. |
| **CMOD** (reporting) | Enterprise data and statement reporting | COF OneLake | **In discovery, owner TBD** |
| **Oracle Cash Management (OCM)** (accounting) | General ledger and reconciliation | FINx | EP and COF Treasury, active. Testing support needed from Global Finance. |
| **Payment Origination (PO)**, the FIS manual-entry screens | Manual creation and entry of corporate wires | OnePay | EP and Ops, active, in refinement. 151 operations users and 500 templates to migrate. |
| **FX (Chase FX for corporate wires)** | FX rates and conversion for corporate wires | Direct JPMC FX rate integration from PayX | EP and Capital Markets, active |
| **FIS dependencies** (legacy integration services) | Vendor integration between DFS and OPF: flat files, FTP | PayX-to-OPF API (new integration pattern) | EP and FIS |
